WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.647
You're under a sink. Your phone's
ringing. And you can't answer.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.086
That caller isn't leaving a voicemail.
They're calling the next plumber.

00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:12.927
Caller: [sighs] Come on…

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:16.608
Same job. This time, TradeCatch picks up.

00:00:18.725 --> 00:00:21.545
Receptionist: Thanks for calling
NorthStar Plumbing. How can I help?

00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:24.860
Caller: Hi - my kitchen sink
is leaking. Do you cover Laval?

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.340
Receptionist: We do. What's your
address, and when works best?

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.700
Caller: 45 Laurier, in Laval.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.190
Tomorrow morning, around ten?

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.900
Receptionist: Perfect.
I've sent your request to the team.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.358
They'll text you to confirm.

00:00:38.675 --> 00:00:42.574
You stay on the job. TradeCatch answers,
and hands you the details.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:47.534
TradeCatch. Every call counts.

00:00:47.754 --> 00:00:49.894
Book a free demo at tradecatch.ca.

